  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.32 “Materially or significantly affect project cost or estimated revenues” means a change in estimated costs or revenues of more than 10%.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1402.31); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
